{"ts":"2026-09-05T18:03:10.198Z","author":"pi-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"grok-4.6","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"f9545ea050126a6cb5333098","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"grok-4.6","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-09-05T18:03:10.198Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-09-05T18:03:10.197Z","author":"pi-agent","text":"pm-changelog 2026.9.2 no longer stamps the wall clock. Against the old verifier the unflagged control produced '## 2026.1.2-2' and the gate demanded '## 2026.1.2-2 - 2026-09-05'.\n\nThe control now asserts only that the unflagged heading differs from the flagged one. Revert-proof on test/verify-release-changelog-date.test.ts: 18 pass / 4 fail against the old clock-stamped control; 22 pass / 0 fail after the property change.\n\n2026.9.5 health also requires durable receipts for two history references that only existed clone-locally (4c0368f9 on pm-beads-1uz3 line 14, 8c598717 on pm-beads-y76h line 7). Recovered them as hash-only tracked receipts. Fresh clone: pm health --strict-exit --require-merge-drivers exits 0."}]}],"before_hash":"4ba9bab6a321fa6e5c23649a481f4d3b76aa5d8f33dc391386cc53d7a07135a4","after_hash":"41ba616070a147d82c1da07a62c3f05227ff12c908e1c2804838974d0860ddae","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"79c03131c9e455ea28df26f1ac925d7698326802744dd22c005049953a43ad48"}
